title: "Arduino Machine Safety Monitor"
abstract: >-
  An open-source machine safety monitor for the Arduino Uno: ultrasonic proximity sensing, temperature and
  rise-rate monitoring, learned vibration limits, tilt and stall detection, a latching emergency stop and a
  live web dashboard. Built for the ENR206 course at Ahmedabad University.
